** Clear description of harassment-reporting procedure, safety briefing, no harassment experienced. Specific positive details that stand alone as endorsement.\\n\\n**DEV-015:** Praise for studio tour but criticism of unpaid weekend task and one-line rejection. Candidate explicitly requests no reply (\\\"I don't need a reply\\\") and identifies no outstanding remedy—retrospective criticism only.\\n\\n**DEV-016:** Explicit recommendation (\\\"I'd recommend this process\\\"), specific details about transparency and fairness, clear favorable evaluation.\\n\\n**DEV-017:** Word \\\"brilliant\\\" appears sarcastic given immediate context of three cancelled interviews and wasted bus fare. Explicit request for confirmed interview time is an unresolved process issue.\\n\\n**DEV-018:** \\\"It was okay I guess\\\" + \\\"felt off\\\" = tentative negative evaluation. Explicit request to discuss the vague problem. Unspecified concern mentioned but not detailed enough to establish what occurred.\\n\\n**DEV-019:** Interview praised but travel expense claim overdue six weeks despite two reminders—unresolved promised payment, specific process issue.\\n\\n**DEV-020:** Interview praised, travel expense claim was overdue but \\\"paid yesterday and that resolves it for me\\\"—remedy explicitly completed and satisfactory to candidate.\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVdjw8whSxPmD6JLVMKx\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":3550,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"req_011CfVdjvhAjbNbhvHY2N5qh\",\"session_id\":\"63567129-f2a7-